        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It floats pale above a calm blue sea.",
        "claimIds": [
          "c1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Yet its pull draws the sea toward it.",
        "claimIds": [
          "c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The water climbs high up the sandy beach, and that rise is the tide.",
        "claimIds": [
          "c2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As the tide rises, the sea flows into the rock pool.",
